            <ArticleTitle>Omento-mesentral myxoid hamartoma--a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>212-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Omento-mesentral myxoid hamartoma, a very rare lesion seen in children, is reported in a three year old child. Its rarity, problem in its clinical pre-operative diagnosis, its characteristic gross and microscopic features, its benign, non recurrent clinical course is stressed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
